            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Plangman, you take on the role of a space pilot imprisoned in a dungeon of forgotten memories. Guess words to reconstruct your past, and use what you learn to rescue the girl you love and defeat the wizard who holds you both prisoner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Deluxe Edition of the game features extras such as an Epilogue, the Lost Levels, a two-player Challenge a Friend mode, and a text-based Level Editor.</p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Plangman, you take on the role of a space pilot imprisoned in a dungeon of forgotten memories. Guess words to reconstruct your past, and use what you learn to rescue the girl you love and defeat the wizard who holds you both prisoner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This Deluxe Edition of the game features extras such as an Epilogue, the Lost Levels, a two-player Challenge a Friend mode, and a text-based Level Editor.</p>",
            "short_description": "Plangman is an Apple II-inspired hangman platformer. Take the word-guessing of Wheel of Fortune, mix in Lode Runner-style puzzle platforming, add the storytelling of a text adventure, throw in a dash of physics, and--voila!--you have Plangman.",
            "supported_languages": "Inglês",
